</tbody>
</table>
<p>LTCC's Forestry Education and Job Placement Program is being funded by the California Department of Forestry and Fire Protection as part of the California Climate Investments Program through the California Tahoe Conservancy.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a title="California Climate Investments" href="https://www.caclimateinvestments.ca.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/ccilogo.jpg" alt="CCI Logo" width="195" height="154" /></a>.&nbsp; <a title="Cal Fire" href="https://www.fire.ca.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/calfirelogo.png" alt="CAL Fire Logo" width="134" height="173" /></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a title="California Tahoe Conservancy" href="https://tahoe.ca.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/ctclogo.png" alt="CTC Logo" width="109" height="156" /></a></p>
